    "regime_notes": "Across the 15 tradable cross-asset instruments, the 10-day IC was negative in 2020-2025 (including -0.05079 in 2025) but positive in 2026-2030, with 0.02422 in 2030 YTD. The small cross-section warrants conservative uncertainty interpretation. Short-horizon predictive power was stronger than 20-day decay.",
